# Wireframe: Shortcut Help Modal

## Purpose & Flow Context

Displays all available keyboard shortcuts organized by category. Entry: user presses "?" on any page. Exit: user presses Escape or clicks close button.

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

All interactive screens inherit these. Per-screen specifics noted where they diverge.

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column layout. Spacing cadence: 8px rhythm intent.

**App-shell**: Shared header + nav + container. Regions:

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Overlay | Semi-transparent backdrop | Click to close |
| Modal Container | Centered modal, max-width 640px | Focus trap |
| Header | Title "Keyboard Shortcuts" + [X] Close | Sticky |
| Content | Scrollable list of shortcuts | Category filters |
| Footer | (none - header only) | — |

**Content hierarchy** (by visual priority):
1. Category filters (Global, List, Issue)
2. Shortcut table (key + action pairs)

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                          [Overlay]                                |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |  Keyboard Shortcuts                            [X]          ||
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |  [All] [Global] [List] [Issue]                              ||
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |                                                              ||
|  |  Global                                                     ||
|  |  +----------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |  |  [C]        Create new issue                             ||
|  |  |  [G][I]     Go to Issues                                 ||
|  |  |  [G][P]     Go to Projects                               ||
|  |  |  [G][C]     Go to Cycles                                 ||
|  |  |  [/]        Search                                       ||
|  |  |  [?]        Show keyboard shortcuts                      ||
|  |  |  [Esc]      Close / Deselect                             ||
|  |  +----------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |                                                              ||
|  |  List                                                       ||
|  |  +----------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |  |  [J]        Move selection down                          ||
|  |  |  [K]        Move selection up                            ||
|  |  |  [Enter]    Open selected item                           ||
|  |  +----------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |                                                              ||
|  |  Issue                                                      ||
|  |  +----------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |  |  [S]        Cycle status                                 ||
|  |  |  [A]        Assign issue                                 ||
|  |  |  [L]        Add label                                    ||
|  |  |  [E]        Edit title                                   ||
|  |  |  [Del]      Delete issue                                 ||
|  |  +----------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |                                                              ||
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

*Legend: [{Button}] [Input] [Link] [#Heading] [>Dropdown] [Avatar] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Overlay | div (backdrop) | Click to close | — |
| [X] Close | Button | Click/Esc to close | Returns focus to trigger |
| Category Tabs | Button group | Click to filter | Default: "All" selected |
| Category Header | h3 | Static text | — |
| Shortcut Row | Table row | Static display | — |
| [Kbd] | Kbd component | Displays key | — |

## Data Display

Table layout with two columns: shortcut keys and action description. No sort, filter, or pagination. Static reference display.

| Column | Content | Width |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Shortcut | Kbd component(s) | 120px fixed |
| Action | Description text | Fluid |

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Modal Title | "Keyboard Shortcuts" | Clear, user-friendly |
| Category: All | Show all shortcuts | Default filter |
| Category: Global | Shortcuts available everywhere | — |
| Category: List | Shortcuts for list views | — |
| Category: Issue | Shortcuts for issue actions | — |
| Action: "Create new issue" | Opens new issue modal | User language |
| Action: "Go to Issues" | Navigates to issues list | — |

## States

### Populated (Default)

All shortcuts displayed, grouped by category. "All" filter selected.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Keyboard Shortcuts                            [X]              |
|  [All] [Global] [List] [Issue]                                  |
|  Global                                                         |
|  [C]        Create new issue                                    |
|  [G][I]     Go to Issues                                        |
|  ...                                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Empty

Not applicable — shortcuts are always available.

### Loading

Not applicable — shortcuts load synchronously.

### Error

Not applicable — no error state.

### Success / Confirmation

Not applicable — no state change.

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Full modal centered, max-width 640px |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Same layout, reduced padding |
| Mobile (<768px) | Full-width modal, scrollable content |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | role="dialog" on modal container |
| Heading order | h1 in page behind modal, h3 for categories |
| Reading / Focus order | Title → Close button → Category tabs → Shortcut list |
| Accessible names | Close button: aria-label="Close keyboard shortcuts" |
| Keyboard operability | Tab cycles within modal, Esc closes |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px on all interactive targets |
| Focus not obscured | Focus trap within modal |
| Non-color intent | Category tabs use text labels, not color alone |

---

# Wireframe: Keyboard Settings

## Purpose & Flow Context

Allows users to view and customize keyboard shortcuts. Entry: user navigates to Settings > Keyboard. Exit: user navigates away or saves changes.

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

All interactive screens inherit these. Per-screen specifics noted where they diverge.

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column layout. Spacing cadence: 8px rhythm intent.

**App-shell**: Shared header + nav + container. Regions:

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Page Header | "Keyboard Settings" title | Sticky |
| Action Bar | [Reset to defaults] button | Top-right |
| Settings List | Scrollable list of shortcuts | Grouped by category |

**Content hierarchy** (by visual priority):
1. Page title
2. Reset to defaults button
3. Shortcut settings list

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Keyboard Settings                          [Reset to defaults]  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                  |
|  Global                                                         |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |  Create new issue      [C]                    [Edit]        ||
|  |  Go to Issues          [G][I]                 [Edit]        ||
|  |  Go to Projects        [G][P]                 [Edit]        ||
|  |  Go to Cycles          [G][C]                 [Edit]        ||
|  |  Search                [/]                    [Edit]        ||
|  |  Show shortcuts        [?]                    [Edit]        ||
|  |  Close / Deselect      [Esc]                  [Edit]        ||
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|                                                                  |
|  List                                                           |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |  Move selection down  [J]                    [Edit]        ||
|  |  Move selection up    [K]                    [Edit]        ||
|  |  Open selected item   [Enter]                [Edit]        ||
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|                                                                  |
|  Issue                                                          |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |  Cycle status         [S]                    [Edit]        ||
|  |  Assign issue         [A]                    [Edit]        ||
|  |  Add label            [L]                    [Edit]        ||
|  |  Edit title           [E]                    [Edit]        ||
|  |  Delete issue         [Del]                  [Edit]        ||
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|                                                                  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

*Legend: [{Button}] [Input] [Link] [#Heading] [>Dropdown] [Avatar] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| [Reset to defaults] | Button | Click to reset (with confirmation) | Shows confirmation dialog |
| Category Header | h3 | Static text | — |
| Shortcut Name | span | Displays action description | — |
| [Kbd] | Kbd component | Displays current key | — |
| [Edit] | Button | Click to enter edit mode | Shows input field |

## Data Display

List layout with three columns: action name, current shortcut, edit button. Grouped by category.

| Column | Content | Width |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Action | Description text | Fluid |
| Shortcut | Kbd component(s) | 100px fixed |
| Edit | Button | 60px fixed |

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Page Title | "Keyboard Settings" | Clear, user-friendly |
| [Reset to defaults] | "Reset to defaults" | Destructive action, shows confirmation |
| Category: Global | Shortcuts available everywhere | — |
| Category: List | Shortcuts for list views | — |
| Category: Issue | Shortcuts for issue actions | — |
| [Edit] | "Edit" | Enters edit mode for shortcut |

## States

### Populated (Default)

All shortcuts displayed with current key combinations. Read-only mode.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Keyboard Settings                          [Reset to defaults]  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Global                                                         |
|  Create new issue      [C]                    [Edit]            |
|  Go to Issues          [G][I]                 [Edit]            |
|  ...                                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Empty

Not applicable — shortcuts always have defaults.

### Loading

Not applicable — settings load synchronously.

### Error

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Keyboard Settings                          [Reset to defaults]  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ⚠  Failed to load keyboard settings                           |
|     [Retry]                                                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Success / Confirmation

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ✓  Keyboard shortcuts reset to defaults                        |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Full-width layout with columns |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Same layout, reduced padding |
| Mobile (<768px) | Stacked layout, full-width rows |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | header, main |
| Heading order | h1 "Keyboard Settings", h3 for categories |
| Reading / Focus order | Page title → Reset button → Category list → Shortcut rows |
| Accessible names | Reset button: aria-label="Reset all keyboard shortcuts to defaults" |
| Keyboard operability | Tab to navigate, Enter to activate edit |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px on all interactive targets |
| Focus not obscured | Scrollable content doesn't hide focus |
| Non-color intent | Edit button uses text, not color alone |

---

# Wireframe: Edit Shortcut Inline

## Purpose & Flow Context

Allows users to input a new key combination for a shortcut. Entry: user clicks [Edit] on a shortcut row. Exit: user saves or cancels the edit.

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

All interactive screens inherit these. Per-screen specifics noted where they diverge.

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column layout. Spacing cadence: 8px rhythm intent.

**App-shell**: Shared header + nav + container. Regions:

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Shortcut Name | Action description | Static |
| Edit Input | Active input field | Captures key press |
| Action Buttons | [Save] [Cancel] | Appears during edit |

**Content hierarchy** (by visual priority):
1. Edit input field
2. Action description
3. Save/Cancel buttons

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Create new issue      _______ [Save] [Cancel]                  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

*Legend: [{Button}] [Input] [Link] [#Heading] [>Dropdown] [Avatar] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Shortcut Name | span | Static text | — |
| Edit Input | Input | Captures key press | Shows current key |
| [Save] | Button | Saves new key combination | Validates conflicts |
| [Cancel] | Button | Cancels edit, reverts | — |
| Conflict Warning | Toast | Shows if key is taken | Error state |

## Data Display

Inline edit within the settings row. No separate data display.

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Input Placeholder | Current key combination | Shows existing key |
| [Save] | "Save" | Confirms new key |
| [Cancel] | "Cancel" | Discards changes |
| Conflict Message | "This key combination is already in use" | Error feedback |

## States

### Populated (Default)

Input field active, showing current key combination.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Create new issue      [C] [Save] [Cancel]                      |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Empty

Not applicable — shortcut always has a key.

### Loading

Not applicable — edit is instant.

### Error

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Create new issue      [X] [Save] [Cancel]                      |
|  ⚠ This key combination is already in use                       |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Success / Confirmation

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Create new issue      [Y]                    [Edit]            |
|  ✓ Shortcut updated                                              |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Inline edit within row |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Same layout |
| Mobile (<768px) | Full-width edit area |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | (inherits from settings page) |
| Heading order | (inherits from settings page) |
| Reading / Focus order | Input → Save → Cancel |
| Accessible names | Input: aria-label="New keyboard shortcut for Create new issue" |
| Keyboard operability | Esc to cancel, Enter to save |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px on Save/Cancel buttons |
| Focus not obscured | Focus stays within edit row |
| Non-color intent | Conflict message uses text + icon |

---

# Wireframe: Delete Confirmation Modal

## Purpose & Flow Context

Confirms destructive issue deletion via keyboard shortcut. Entry: user presses Delete on selected issue. Exit: user confirms (Y) or cancels (N/Esc).

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

All interactive screens inherit these. Per-screen specifics noted where they diverge.

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column layout. Spacing cadence: 8px rhythm intent.

**App-shell**: Shared header + nav + container. Regions:

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Overlay | Semi-transparent backdrop | Click to cancel |
| Modal Container | Centered modal, max-width 400px | Focus trap |
| Header | "Delete Issue" title | — |
| Content | Confirmation message | — |
| Footer | [Delete] [Cancel] buttons | — |

**Content hierarchy** (by visual priority):
1. Confirmation message
2. Delete button (danger)
3. Cancel button

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                          [Overlay]                                |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |  Delete Issue                                               ||
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |                                                              ||
|  |  Are you sure you want to delete this issue?                ||
|  |  This action cannot be undone.                               ||
|  |                                                              ||
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |  [Delete]                              [Cancel]              ||
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

*Legend: [{Button}] [Input] [Link] [#Heading] [>Dropdown] [Avatar] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Overlay | div (backdrop) | Click to cancel | — |
| Header | h2 | Static text | — |
| Content | p | Static text | — |
| [Delete] | Button (danger) | Confirms deletion | Focus trap |
| [Cancel] | Button | Cancels deletion | — |

## Data Display

No data display — confirmation dialog only.

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Title | "Delete Issue" | Clear action |
| Message | "Are you sure you want to delete this issue?" | Confirmation |
| Warning | "This action cannot be undone." | Reversibility notice |
| [Delete] | "Delete" | Destructive action, danger styling |
| [Cancel] | "Cancel" | Safe exit |

## States

### Populated (Default)

Modal visible with confirmation message.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Delete Issue                                                   |
|  Are you sure you want to delete this issue?                    |
|  This action cannot be undone.                                   |
|  [Delete]                              [Cancel]                  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Empty

Not applicable — always has content.

### Loading

Not applicable — deletion is instant.

### Error

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Delete Issue                                                   |
|  Are you sure you want to delete this issue?                    |
|  This action cannot be undone.                                   |
|  ⚠ Failed to delete issue. Please try again.                    |
|  [Delete]                              [Cancel]                  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Success / Confirmation

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ✓ Issue deleted                                                |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Centered modal, max-width 400px |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Same layout |
| Mobile (<768px) | Full-width modal |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | role="dialog" on modal container |
| Heading order | h2 "Delete Issue" |
| Reading / Focus order | Title → Message → Delete → Cancel |
| Accessible names | Delete button: aria-label="Confirm delete issue" |
| Keyboard operability | Y to confirm, N/Esc to cancel |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px on Delete/Cancel buttons |
| Focus not obscured | Focus trap within modal |
| Non-color intent | Warning text + icon, not color alone |

